---
name: node-test-discovery
description: Wiring a `node --test` invocation so it actually finds the suite. Loaded for any edit of a workflow or package.json test script.
metadata:
  body: guidelines
  usage:
    expect: triggered
  force-load-on-file-edits-paths:
    - ".github/workflows/**"
    - "package.json"
    - "*/package.json"
---
